BU_: VCU AMI


BO_ 1760 CAN_OTA_VCU_To_AMI: 8 VCU
 SG_ RxOpcode M : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ EnterSession m1 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ EnterKey0 m1 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ EnterKey1 m1 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
