 SG_ EnterKey5 m1 : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ StartSession m16 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ StartTarget m16 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ StartFlags m16 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ StartImageSize m16 : 32|32@1+ (1,0) [0|12582912] "byte" AMI
 SG_ EndSession m17 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
