 SG_ ActivateDelay m18 : 48|8@1+ (100,0) [0|25500] "ms" AMI
 SG_ ActivateReserved m18 : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ AbortSession m19 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ QuerySession m20 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ DataByte1 m128 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
 SG_ DataByte2 m128 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AMI
