BO_ 1761 CAN_OTA_AMI_To_VCU: 8 AMI
 SG_ TxOpcode M : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" VCU
 SG_ EnterAckSession m129 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" VCU
 SG_ EnterAckStatus m129 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|11] "" VCU
 SG_ EnterAckRecovery m129 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" VCU
 SG_ ReadyStatus m144 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|11] "" VCU
 SG_ ReadyProtocolVersion m144 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" VCU
