 SG_ VerifyStatus m147 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|11] "" VCU
 SG_ VerifyState m147 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|2] "" VCU
 SG_ VerifyReceivedSize m147 : 32|32@1+ (1,0) [0|12582912] "byte" VCU
